# Legacy Management Deprecation

- `management/backend` and `management/frontend` are deprecated rollback
  surfaces. Do not add features.
- `kubernetes/base-services/management` is not part of default cluster
  bootstrap; `kubernetes/legacy-management` is opt-in rollback only.
- New AQP control-plane routes belong in
  `agentic_quant_platform/aqp_control_plane`.
- New operator UI features belong in `agentic_quant_platform/aqp_client`.
- SDK changes should prefer `AqpControlPlaneClient` for AQP workload
  lifecycle operations.



AQP path contract: `docs/aqp-monorepo-paths.md`.
